  "description": "The meme perpetuates the harmful trope that racial categorization can be used to generate judgments about the seriousness or moral weight of an action. This concept is not visible in the image but is implied by the text 'when you are white and stole your first bike', which suggests that the act is more noteworthy based on race.",
